"name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"I6L0Zxi5Ww0zEWSAVgngeQ","review_id":"VaGldgzPZ_xDgwyJjQpFgA","date":"2015-02-15T17:56:36","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9546337723731995,"text_excerpt":"I think the beignets here are not as good as Cafe Du Monde's, but you can drink alcohol here! Plenty of outdoor seating with live music allll day. This place also takes credit cards. You order, take a number, find seat, and the food will be brought to you. Also, no line, located in the middle of Bourbon St. so if you need a break from the walking/drinking/partying, you can take a seat, listen to some live music, munch on some sugar, and drink some more! We did just that with a daquiri, sazerac, and of course an order of NOLA's favorite pastry. I didn't get to try anything other than drinks and beignets, but if I were to come back here, I would try the crawfish omelet and maybe some waffle..."},{"business_id":"I6L0Zxi5Ww0zEWSAVgngeQ","review_id":"AOh5Wx2bhf1sbxQvqQTs3w","date":"2015-11-10T18:40:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.946171760559082,"text_excerpt":"I wouldn't say their beignets are better than Cafe Du Monde's but they are pretty good. It might really be the open courtyard ambiance and live music playing day and night that attracts many here. I admit, that was the allure for us. Dining al fresco under some shade with fans blowing was a nice retreat from the busy Bourbon St. All that, plus a cup of CAFE AU LAIT ($2.99/sm) and an order of delightful BEIGNETS ($3.99), I felt right with the world. I can't say I'm not a fan."},{"business_id":"I6L0Zxi5Ww0zEWSAVgngeQ","review_id":"_QKRrluNZPMzxaZ_i_089A","date":"2015-01-25T19:50:19","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9451070427894592,"text_excerpt":"I love this place. I don't understand why anyone would spend an hour waiting to eat beignets at Café du Monde (and way overpay) instead of coming here. $4 for 3 delicious beignets and live jazz music is my choice. Plus the rest of the menu is great. My only complaint (but not their fault) is having to walk through the Bourbon street sleeve to get there."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"I6L0Zxi5Ww0zEWSAVgngeQ","photo_id":"RUWTwyNzdOPBTFCKdEU-Qg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/RUWTwyNzdOPBTFCKdEU-Qg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8620115518569946},{"business_id":"I6L0Zxi5Ww0zEWSAVgngeQ","photo_id":"MTlL9pKfGPVTc4h-9bedJA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/MTlL9pKfGPVTc4h-9bedJA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8463355302810669},{"business_id":"I6L0Zxi5Ww0zEWSAVgngeQ","photo_id":"KtsciYMu-61LWT6bosixQA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/KtsciYMu-61LWT6bosixQA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8316863775253296},{"business_id":"I6L0Zxi5Ww0zEWSAVgngeQ","photo_id":"lvzrZa8_W945tz7sE93Qug","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/lvzrZa8_W945tz7sE93Qug.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7553730010986328},{"business_id